**Description:** Outlines how Cursor.ai should generate metadata, including fields, objects, permissions, and configurations.

### **5.1 Custom Fields, Objects & Relationships**
- Generate metadata **only if necessary**.
- Justify all new fields and objects with **descriptive comments**.

### **5.2 Security & Profiles**
- If needed, generate **Permission Sets** instead of modifying Profiles.

### **5.3 Custom Labels & Internationalization**
- Use **Custom Labels** for user-facing text.